      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "私は珍しい金貨や硬貨を蒐集している者です。\nジール硬貨の持ち主を探していたのですが\n巨人の足跡砦で、その足取りが途絶えました。\n今でもそこに？　確認と確保をお願いできますか？",
        "official_en": "I've been searching for the owner of the Djilu coin,\nbut they went missing around Giant's-Print Fort.\nCould the coin still be there? If it is, could you get\nit for me?",
        "real_en": "I've been searching for the owner of the Djilu coin,\nbut they went missing around Giant's Footprint Fort.\nCould the coin still be there? If it is, could you get\nit for me?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
