      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ジール硬貨だけが落ちていた……ということは\n持ち主は、命を落とされたということでしょうか。\nご苦労様です。対価はお支払いします。硬貨は\nご家族の元へ、お返ししようと思います。",
        "official_en": "Only the Djilu coin was found... Does that mean the\nowner is no longer with us? In that case, I should\nreturn this coin to their family. Thank you for doing\nyour part. You've still earned your reward.",
